  "title": "Potato Chocolate Cake",
  "description": "Leftover mashed potatoes give this chocolate cake a velvety texture. Add 1 teaspoon each cinnamon and allspice for a chocolate spice cake!",
  "authors": [
    "LOUANNL"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-03-22T13:31:58-05:00",
